      "category": "Badges",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed several Accolades so that players now receive the correct bonus."
    },
    {
      "category": "Badges",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed bug related to Accolades and leveling up that made characters appear to have the wrong number of Enhancement slots while training."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed a display bug with Hasten where, if Hasten ended while a Power with a long recharge time was recharging, the Power would appear as ready to use before it had finished recharging. Actual recharge times unchanged."
    },
